#: ../../source/docs/dev-conference.rst:5 440aacacf46b4c189e3e8ebb8d5215ae
msgid "Developers Conference 2024"
msgstr "2024 年开发者大会"

#: ../../source/docs/dev-conference.rst:10 40e60d77fa9840b49577b27ca75bf455
msgid ""
"The 2025 ArduPilot developer conference will be held in Yorkshire, UK from "
"Fri Sep 5th ~ Sep 7th (`blog <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/ardupilot-"
"developer-conference-2025-september-5th-7th-in-yorkshire-uk/128501>`__)"
msgstr ""
"2025 年 ArduPilot 开发者大会将于 9 月 5 日（周五）至 9 月 7 日在英国约克郡举办（`博客 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/ardupilot-developer-"
"conference-2025-september-5th-7th-in-yorkshire-uk/128501>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/dev-conference.rst:16 8521b9e6957d4c97b28d218efc4a4980
msgid "Past Conferences"
msgstr "历届大会"

#: ../../source/docs/dev-conference.rst:20 66f916ebedd548499577df475a81ef25
msgid ""
"The 2024 ArduPilot developer conference was held in `Kaga, Ishikawa Japan "
"<https://visitkaga.jp/>`__ from Oct 25th to 27th. As with previous years the"
" conference was a mix of presentations, live demonstrations and lots of "
"discussion including what we should do next"
msgstr ""
"2024 年 ArduPilot 开发者大会于 10 月 25 日至 27 日在`日本石川县加贺市 "
"<https://visitkaga.jp/>`__举办。与往年一样，大会融合了演讲、现场演示和大量讨论，包括未来的发展方向"

